  "notes": [
    "The latest change the exploit needed is configureReserveAsCollateral giving PPI a 65% LTV; the feed deployment and AaveOracle source assignment precede it, and the same block's enableBorrowing and reserve-factor writes are not used. Markets listed later only change the loss size.",
    "xCFX, ABC and NUT are valued at the CFX their sale returned (rule 12): the attacker dumped 52-96% of each Swappi pool's reserve. The other assets use DefiLlama prices. The 6M xCFX deposited and re-borrowed in the same transaction is excluded; the PPI collateral left behind is not netted.",
    "Conflux eSpace's public RPC serves trace_transaction and historical state but not trace_filter or prestate traces; no earlier or later PPI deposit of comparable size exists, so the campaign is empty."
